# The operator crate builds as its own Cargo workspace; ignore only its build
# output, never its sources.
/target/

# `src/bin/generate_crd_yaml.rs` is real crate source (the generate-crd-yaml
# bin declared in Cargo.toml). Re-include the directory against the repo-root
# `bin/` rule, which would otherwise swallow the whole `src/bin` dir.
!/src/bin/
